      "code": "OPERATIONS_MANAGER",
      "cross_product": false,
      "description": "Raises, approves and receives purchase orders org-wide; maintains suppliers and inventory (including stock adjustments); reads warehouses. Accepts, cancels and hands over customer orders \u2014 the stock-commitment, stock-release and billing-gate steps \u2014 on top of the ordinary counter work every Operations user does. Does not create or rename warehouses \u2014 that stays with the admin.",
