    {
      "code": "OPERATIONS_WORKER",
      "cross_product": false,
      "description": "The picker/packer role the worker PWA authenticates as (plan F3). Sees the task board and the worker roster read-only, executes only the tasks offered or accepted to them (`task.execute` tops out at OWN \u2014 even this role cannot execute another worker's task), sets their own presence, and confirms packages. Does not offer, reassign or override a task \u2014 that stays with the dispatcher (`OPERATIONS_MANAGER`).",
